    "summary": "Adds a deterministic documentation-manifest document and a read-only freshness evaluation. A manifest binds one repository-scoped context packet, declared local and external inputs, generator identity, output bytes, generated and human-authored regions, and executable-example identities. Freshness names every changed, missing, unresolved, or unverified declared input without claiming that unchanged inputs make narrative text correct.\n",
